Use the graph to find $f(1)$ and identify every discontinuity.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},draw=black]
\draw[->] (-1.2,0)--(5.5,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-0.6)--(0,4.6) node[above] {$y$};
\foreach \x in {1,2,3,4,5}{\draw (\x,0.07)--(\x,-0.07);\node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (\x,-0.07) {$\x$};}
\foreach \y in {1,2,3,4}{\draw (0.07,\y)--(-0.07,\y);\node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (-0.07,\y) {$\y$};}
\draw[thick,<-] (-1,1)--(1,3);
\draw[thick,->] (1,1)--(5.1,1);
\fill[black] (1,3) circle (2.5pt);
\draw[fill=white] (1,1) circle (2.5pt);
\draw[fill=white] (4,1) circle (2.5pt);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
